{"id":10339,"bangumiId":10339,"type":2,"name":"青の祓魔師","name_cn":"青之驱魔师","date":"2011-04-17","year":"2011","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg"},"summary":"青之驱魔师所写的世界由两个空间组成，并像镜般连为一体。人类居住的物质界为本作舞台，另外还有恶魔居住的虚无界。平常基本上无法接触或穿梭于两界之间。可是恶魔能凭依于相当的物质从而进入人类的世界。撒旦乃众魔之神，为了从人间捡回一个能抑制他的箱子，而诞下了奥村磷——他跟一人界女子的儿子。可是撒旦的密谋未能得到到磷的认同。及后撒旦更杀掉了磷的监护人养父，并要带磷返去虚无界。这使磷开始了驱魔师之旅，就为了打败他的生父撒旦。","rating":{"rank":2348,"total":7015,"count":{"1":17,"2":17,"3":37,"4":117,"5":435,"6":1469,"7":2485,"8":1734,"9":377,"10":327},"score":7.1},"collection":{"on_hold":811,"dropped":535,"wish":1896,"collect":9486,"doing":1998},"tags":[{"name":"青の祓魔師","count":1556,"total_count":1779},{"name":"兄弟","count":975,"total_count":1682},{"name":"热血","count":883,"total_count":219161},{"name":"2011年4月","count":760,"total_count":23993},{"name":"福山潤","count":630,"total_count":5236},{"name":"JUMP","count":560,"total_count":33761},{"name":"TV","count":454,"total_count":1449077},{"name":"神谷浩史","count":433,"total_count":30122},{"name":"花澤香菜","count":356,"total_count":6983},{"name":"恶魔","count":309,"total_count":1012},{"name":"2011","count":291,"total_count":54082},{"name":"冈本信彦","count":284,"total_count":1407},{"name":"战斗","count":239,"total_count":491321},{"name":"尼桑","count":239,"total_count":243},{"name":"漫画改","count":234,"total_count":894786},{"name":"A-1Pictures","count":226,"total_count":148479},{"name":"蓝色驱魔师","count":181,"total_count":183},{"name":"2011四月番","count":167,"total_count":320},{"name":"奇幻","count":159,"total_count":493906},{"name":"漫改","count":103,"total_count":370807},{"name":"游佐浩二","count":77,"total_count":527},{"name":"日本","count":48,"total_count":315964},{"name":"青之驱魔